  "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiotic_projection_1",
  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the speaker persona represented by the man in the image",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man in the image, who is visually mapped as the speaker of the misogynistic text. The text uses 'you' ('all the ladies', 'the rest of you bitches') and implicitly 'me' (the speaker) to address the viewer. The user is positioned as the recipient of the speaker's message, which is delivered through the man's confident, wealthy visual persona. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'man' and the TextualMaterial entity 'text_chunk_1', as the man's appearance and the text together construct the speaker's persona.",
